        "created_at": "2016-02-14T02:49:21.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The Bloodstone was made directly from Bugbear's life force and ancient magics.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I've often wondered what the pink crystal GloomWeaver holds is, but I doubt it is an OblivAeon shard. I don't know why, but the feel of it doesn't match the rest for some reason. I think it is a respresentation of Earth or the dreams of people or something. His connection to the realm he feeds on.</p>",
