        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"TheSoundOfTrees\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/da6949/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> TheSoundOfTrees:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Christopher said \"there have been at least a couple of OblivAeon shards written about in other Sentinel Comics character backstories\". I agree the Scholar's stone <em>may</em> be one of them, it does not mean :that there aren't othersespecially elsewhere than in backstories : on the cards.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>he said there was \"at least 2\". Just so we get the quote right here.&nbsp;</p>",
