        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/da6949/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2016-02-14T12:08:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I guess the transcript I copied the quote from was wrong, then.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>EDIT</p><p>Let's be precise.</p><p>Source : Matchstickman' transcript.</p><p>theshypinkiepie: @Gtgchristopher so would it be too much to ask how FT. Adamant got a hold of OblivAeon shards before his appearance at Ft. Adamant? (if I got the sequence of events right)<br>GTGChristopher: @Theshypinkiepie They must have found them somewhere. In fact, there have been at least a couple of OblivAeon shards written about in other Sentinel Comics character backstories, as well!</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The \" at least two\" you are referring comes from :</p><p>DWSetback: Before the Void Guard reveal, how many Oblivion shards have we seen or heard about in the game?<br>GTGChristopher: @Dwsetback At least two</p>",
